```
6. Handle errors and edge cases: When implementing TCP in TypeScript, make sure to handle errors and edge cases, such as connection timeouts, data corruption, and disconnections.

By following these steps, you can create a TCP server and client in TypeScript using the 'net' module. Keep in mind that this is a high-level overview, and implementing a full TCP protocol requires a deep understanding of the protocol and its intricacies."]

